# Python 3.13 is present due to the Debian base image but not used at runtime.
# Gotenberg is a Go application and no Python processes are started.
# The vulnerability affects Python's http.client module and is not exploitable
# in this container.
CVE-2025-13836

# This CVE only affects regular expressions on 32-bit systems. Our software
# (Classic and MultiNode) is explicitly 64-bit, so this vulnerability cannot
# be exploited on our CES systems.
CVE-2026-8376
